      "writtenOn": "2025-02-04T10:56:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For most Vulkan features there shouldn\u0027t be a cost to enabling them. It\u0027s just that the spec says there might be a cost. But for these, either the HW supports the thing or it doesn\u0027t imho. (again, this is optional)",
